                            {
                                "example_id": "76e6ed76-4da9-47f6-9675-a02bc0a217c1",
                                "sense_id": "b5657a6f-4426-3e00-bd07-85db8f5d5dec",
                                "text": "Our first precise information is contained in a Deed of Mutual Covenants dated October 1, 1863, and made between the Rhosydd Slate Co. Ltd. and H. B. Roberts, whereby the latter granted the company a wayleave under which it constructed a railway and incline from its property to the Croesor Tramway. The original wayleave was 2d. a ton, [...]."
